.)), declined regul. ",{"g":"υἱοῦ, υἱῷ, υἱόν,"}," but in Att. Inscrr. only after ",{"c":"350","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0081.tlg009:350"}," B.C. (exc. ",{"g":"υἱός"}," IG 12.529,530, 598, 625; ",{"g":"ὑός"}," ib. 585, 828; ",{"g":"ὑόν"},"ib.70.8), and then always so: —in earlier Att. and other Inscrr. inflected as a ",{"g":"ῠ"},"-stem (like ",{"g":"πῆχυς"},"), nom. ",{"g":"υἱύς"}," (written huihus) Klein Vasen mit Meister-signaturen 72 (Brit.Mus.Cat. 701) ( ",{"g":"ὑύς"}," IG 12.571, 670, 686; contr. ",{"g":"ὕς"}," ib.663); gen. ",{"g":"υἱέος "},"( ",{"g":"ὑέος"}," IG 22.4883); dat. ",{"g":"υἱεῖ"},": dual ",{"g":"υἱεῖ"},{"c":"Lys. 19.46","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0540.tlg019.perseus-grc1:46"},", written ",{"g":"ηυιε"}," in IG 12.775 (corrupted to ",{"g":"υἱέε"}," in ",{"c":"Pl. Ap. 20a","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0059.tlg002.perseus-grc1:20a"}," cod. B), ",{"g":"υἱέοιν"},": pl. ",{"g":"υἱεῖς "},"( ",{"g":"ὑεῖς"}," IG 12.115.14, al.), ",{"g":"υἱέων, υἱέσι"}," (",{"c":"S. Ant. 571","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tlg002.perseus-grc1:571"},", ",{"c":"Ar. Nu. 1001","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0019.tlg003.perseus-grc1:1001"}," (anap.)), ",{"g":"ὑέ[σιν"},"] (IG 12.54.14), ",{"g":"υἱεῖς "},"( ",{"g":"ὑεῖς"}," IG 22.1.73): but gen. ",{"g":"υἱέως,"}," and acc. ",{"g":"υἱέα, υἱέας,"}," which are formed as though from nom. ",{"g":"Υἱεύς,"}," are rejected by Phryn. 48,49, Thom.Mag.p.367 R., as not Att., though the two latter forms are used by later writers (as ",{"g":"υἱέα"},{"c":"Euph. 5","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0221.tlg001:5"},", ",{"c":"Arr. Cyn. 16","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0074.tlg003:16"},", ",{"g":"ὑέα"}," IG 42(1).244.4 (Epid., ii B. C.), but ",{"g":"υἱέως"}," is f. l. in ",{"c":"Th. 1.13","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0003.tlg001.perseus-grc1:1:13"},", ",{"c":"J. AJ 18.2.4","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0526.tlg001.perseus-grc1:18:2:4"},", etc.): dat. pl. ",{"g":"υἱεῦσιν"}," is mentioned as a form that would be regular by ",{"c":"Eust. 1348.27","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg4083.tlg001:1348: